join anemon leftmost [animation="Instant In"]
join whale center
anemon: So Ms.Whale, you're the owner of this fine establishment ?
whale: Yes. I thought I could carry the elderly on their last voyage.
whale: I didn't mean to have it sound like that. I just really wanted to give them some company and a nice place to be in their elderly days. Shouldering their burdens with them I suppose ?
anemon: And so you invited Shrimp on WhaleBack ?
whale: Shrimp and I go way back! We were friends even before she came aboard. We met at a protest for the fish's rights and it instantly clicked. We had the interests, same hobbies, same views on the world ! Inviting her aboard was only natural and she quickly got along with the other residents.
anemon: So she didn't have bad blood with anyone here ?
whale: She was never really close with Lightbrarian but I wouldn't say they hated each other. Just, didn't match.
anemon: Anyone else she may not have gotten along with ?
whale: Well... her relation with Sharko soured with the years. Recently I often overheard them fighting.
anemon: What about ?
whale: I couldn't say. I didn't pry.
anemon: And when was the last time you saw Shrimp ?
whale: Just before the supper. We had gotten into the habit of chatting everyday at that time. Sharing our latest thoughts and feelings.
anemon: Was Shrimp worried about something recently ?
whale: If she was, she didn't tell me.
set {NextDialogue.whale} = "nothing_whale"